xt","data":{"text":"<a href=\"#ref-n-fzV7kY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">For Your Event</a>","type":"paragraph","textSize":"small"}},"n-wwvgPH":{"type":"text","data":{"text":"<em>This media kit will be updated throughout the year. </em>","type":"paragraph","textSize":"small"}},"n-QNHgEH":{"type":"briefing-slide","data":{"layout":"titleless-flexible","contents":{"0":"n-NtkDxl","1":["n-pbRJLQ","n-ybEdMn","n-gu1dDM","n-ONbyAm","n-LjLCzw","n-SbXT0f","n-HSOJvJ","n-MG914F","n-wwvgPH"]},"sublayout":{"cols":3,"rows":1,"items":[{"colStart":0,"colEnd":1,"rowStart":0,"rowEnd":1},{"colStart":1,"colEnd":3,"rowStart":0,"rowEnd":1}]},"displayTitle":"Table of Contents"}},"n-RRVN9Q":{"type":"image","data":{"image":"r-06GAFe","isInFullView":false,"isExpandable":true},"config":{"placement":{"type":"fill","fill":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"fit":{"color":"backgroundColor"}}}},"n-4QOYfR":{"type":"text","data":{"text":"GIS: Powering Purpose and Innovation","type":"h3"}},"n-ktVv6e":{"type":"text","data":{"text":"On GIS Day, we celebrate the innovators, problem-solvers, and storytellers who use geographic information system (GIS) technology to make a difference—proving that when purpose meets technology, the possibilities are limitless.  ","type":"paragraph","textSize":"small"}},"n-wYJrUX":{"type":"text","data":{"text":"GIS is more than maps—it’s a catalyst for meaningful change. This theme highlights how geospatial technology empowers organizations, communities, and individuals to turn purpose into action and ideas into meaningful impact. From advancing sustainability and resilience to improving public services and driving smarter business decisions, GIS connects data, people, and places in ways that fuel innovation.  ","type":"paragraph","textSize":"small"}},"n-3Qdgvs":{"type":"text","data":{"text":"At its core, GIS enables us to see patterns, understand relationships, and solve complex problems with clarity and confidence. Whether you’re mapping critical infrastructure, analyzi